Sat Oct 17 16:45:29 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.3.0~git0.ea53586:
  * Preferences are now stored between launches (config file).
  * Option to re-open Myxer at the same window position.
  * Fixed the About page link to point at the project repository.
  * Fixed dependency versions.
- Drop fix-gio-dep.patch: adopted upstream (gio dependency now
  carries a version).
- Refresh the _service-generated tarball and vendor.tar.xz:
  convert the legacy mode="disabled" services to mode="manual"
  and retarget obs_scm at 1.3.0.
- Fix the package description (was a placeholder).
- Drop cargo_config (Source2): the refreshed vendor.tar.xz ships
  an equivalent .cargo/config.toml itself.

